  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi bara hayyu Hezekiani garaa tokooni AABBO Waaqa hojate kaani, Senakeribuni, hayyuuni Ashuru, lafa Yuda had'e. Inni dira jabeesani, jaarani ch'ufa marse, askarti isatini, naabo isaa ch'ach'absa had'a jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiani aka Senakeribuni dira Yerusalemule had'u fed'e arginaani ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isaafi hojattuuni isaa, aka bisaani maddaa ka dira suniti yaa, kutani woliini malatani; aka, akasiini hojja worri Ashuru Yerusalemuti d'iaatu, bisaani d'abu. Hojatuni taani nama heddu wolti baafte, madda bisaani kutani bisaani yau d'owani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.3+2CH.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.3",
              "2CH.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyichi dira jabeese naabo jaare, doofile ch'ufa gubbati jaare, naabo sunini alalleti naabo d'ibi jaare. Ammalle inni dira Yerusalemu, gama dullachaani ilaboru, fulla jabeesani lafa duuchani taani irati jaarani, mid'aase jaare. Inni ammalle woraanafi wonte heddu mid'aase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nama d'iira ka dira suni ch'ufa nama mataa iti tolche, ballinna fulla fullo dira suniti wolti baase waan jed'eeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaafina, garaa jabaad'a, hayyu Ashurutifi duula isaa gudda muumme inqamne suni insodatina. Irreeni teennafi ta isaa takaniti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irreeni isaa ta namaati, ammo teenna ta AABBO Waaqa keennati, ka nu qarqaare nyaapa keenna nuraa d'owu. Biyyiti dubbi hayyu tana d'ageete jennaani garaa jabaate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi suni ato Senakeribufi askartini isaa dira Lakishi haatu, inni qonqo tana gara Hezekiatifi worra Yuda, ka isa woliini Yerusalemu jiru, erge waan jed'eeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Senakeribuni, hayyuuni Ashuru, waan jed'u, Isani maani abdatani, ka dira Yerusalemu ka marsani had'ani, keesa ch'iiftani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiani, AABBO Waaqa keesaniti harka keenna keesaa isani baasa isaniini jed'a, ammo inni ufuma isani sobe, beelafi d'eebuni isani hobaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami fulla AABBO Waaqa iti kad'atani sorio baasanifi balleese, ka worra Yudatifi ka Yerusalemu waan sorio irati baasani toko ch'alla irati sorio baasisise isaniti? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isani waan anaafi ababooti tiyya worra gosa d'ibi tolchine imbeetani? Waaqi hedduuni gosa d'ibi taka worra isaani ya harka hayyu Ashuru keesaa baase?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi lafa suni tokoleeni yoomi taka harka keenna keesaa worra baase? Duuba maaniti, aka Waaqi keesani isani baasu, isani heresisa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma soba Hezekiani tae isaniini balleesu kana ee injed'ina. Isa ind'ugeefatina! Waaqi gosa d'ibi taka worra ufi harka hayyu Ashuru jalaa imbaamne. Tanaafi Waaqi keesani kuninileeni dandae isani imbaasu!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojattuuni Ashuru waan hagasi ira hamtule, waan AABBO Waaqatifi hojattu isaa Hezekia, dubbate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tatabeeni hayyichi t'aafe taani AABBO Waaqa Israeli aka hama gurra balleesite waan jette, Waaqi gochiti d'ibiini yaamatuleeni, taka gosa isa harka kiyya keesaa imbaamne, Waaqi Hezekialeeni akasuma dandae worra ufi harka kiyya keesaa imbaasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani hojatuni taani afaani Ebraniatini dubbi tana lalabde, aka worra Yerusalemu, ka naabo ira ch'iisu, sodaachise mudamsiisu aka akanaani dira suni yoosu dabsatani qabani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle worri Waaqa Yerusalemu, akuma Waaqa gosa d'ibi, ka harkaani mid'aasani kaani, sehe miid'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani hayyu Hezekiafi raagi Isaya jed'ani, ka ilma Amozi, AABBO Waaqati bohani qarqaarsa kad'atani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani AABBO Waaqi malaika ufi erge malaikaani suni askarti Ashurutifi jara gugurda worrale hobaafte. Akanaani hayyichi Ashuru, ka ch'eeraani injirre, kae, lafa ufiti gale. Guyya toko, ato inni Mana Waaqa isaa keesa tau, ilmaani isaa hagi toko d'ufte goraadeeni isa ijeefte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanaani AABBO Waaqi hayyu Hezekiafi worra Yerusalemu harka Senakeribu hayyu Ashurutifi nyaapa d'ibile jalaa baase lafa worraa, mirgaa bitaa ch'ufa, nagaya tolche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami hedduuni Yerusalemu d'ufe, AABBO Waaqaa waan heddu baase Hezekiale wo kenne, duuba akanaani gochiti ch'ufti Hezekia ulfinna kenniteefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fayyad'abafi kiyyiba Hezekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bara suni Hezekiani fayyad'abe duud'ame, jennaani AABBO Waaqa kad'ate, AABBO Waaqi akheekha inni fayyuni isaa kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo Hezekiani aka hama kiyyibe, galata wollaale, waan AABBO Waaqi tolche ded'e, jennaani wollaali isaa suni Yudafi Yerusalemu badi itiini d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo eege Hezekiafi worri Yerusalemu kiyyiba suni lakise ufi diqeese, tanaafi AABBO Waaqi worra suni haga Hezekiani jiru imballeesine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Durooma Hezekiatifi jabeenna isaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyu Hezekiani aka male woi horate gurra baafate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni mana worqifi qarsifi d'akhaaye ch'uch'ulut'ufi qumbifi wonteefi miha gati qabu d'ibile keesati olkayu jaarate. Ammalle mana d'ibile ka mid'aanifi daad'ifi d'ad'a keesati olkeyatu jaarate, mana looni iti galanifi ka reeni iti galtule jaarate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tana malele, Waaqi loonifi reefi waan heddu d'ibile kenneefi. Tanaafi inni dira heddu d'ibile jaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami maddo Gihoni duuche bisaani isii lafa iti fallanse gara dira Yerusalemu qajeelche, Hezekia. Wonti inni tolche ch'ufti eebifamte, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammalle gaafa jari jaaroleeni Babiloni isati ergite d'ufe waan akheekha waaqi tolche isa odeefate, Waaqi Hezekia yalabahe, aka akasiini isaa ilaalate, waan garaa isaa keesa jira hubatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
